{
  "episode": 35120,
  "speakers": [
    {
      "speaker": "甄嬛",
      "speaker_description": "young#female#皇帝的妃嫔，为皇上排忧解难并推荐福晋去劝说敦亲王"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "皇上",
      "speaker_description": "middle#male#清朝皇帝，因敦亲王之事烦心且感叹群臣无用，正与甄嬛商议对策"
    }
  ],
  "dialogue": [
    {
      "speaker": "甄嬛",
      "text_zh": "其实皇上",
      "text_en": "Your Majesty,",
      "start_ms": 80,
      "end_ms": 760,
      "source": "asr#1"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "甄嬛",
      "text_zh": "大可不必用处罚敦亲王",
      "text_en": "you really do not need to punish Prince Dun",
      "start_ms": 1200,
      "end_ms": 3040,
      "source": "asr#2"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "甄嬛",
      "text_zh": "来平息此事。",
      "text_en": "to settle this.",
      "start_ms": 3240,
      "end_ms": 4240,
      "source": "asr#3"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "甄嬛",
      "text_zh": "文臣群情激昂，",
      "text_en": "The civil officials are all upset,",
      "start_ms": 5820,
      "end_ms": 6980,
      "source": "asr#4"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "甄嬛",
      "text_zh": "不过是想要一个说法。",
      "text_en": "They just want a [response].",
      "start_ms": 7660,
      "end_ms": 8980,
      "source": "asr#5",
      "vocab_word": "response",
      "vocab_card_id": "vocab_0000"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "甄嬛",
      "text_zh": "皇上给他们一个说法就是了。",
      "text_en": "Just give them one.",
      "start_ms": 9980,
      "end_ms": 11820,
      "source": "asr#6"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "甄嬛",
      "text_zh": "最好的",
      "text_en": "The best way",
      "start_ms": 13530,
      "end_ms": 14210,
      "source": "asr#7"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "甄嬛",
      "text_zh": "便是让敦亲王",
      "text_en": "is to have Prince Dun",
      "start_ms": 14810,
      "end_ms": 16010,
      "source": "asr#8"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "甄嬛",
      "text_zh": "登门致歉。",
      "text_en": "apologize in person.",
      "start_ms": 16690,
      "end_ms": 17490,
      "source": "asr#9"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "皇上",
      "text_zh": "让敦亲王登门致歉？",
      "text_en": "Have Prince Dun apologize in person?",
      "start_ms": 18450,
      "end_ms": 20450,
      "source": "asr#10"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "甄嬛",
      "text_zh": "嗯。",
      "text_en": "Yes.",
      "start_ms": 20890,
      "end_ms": 21130,
      "source": "asr#11"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "皇上",
      "text_zh": "他那么心高气傲的，",
      "text_en": "He is so proud,",
      "start_ms": 21930,
      "end_ms": 23330,
      "source": "asr#12"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "皇上",
      "text_zh": "简直还不如杀了他。",
      "text_en": "He would rather die.",
      "start_ms": 23850,
      "end_ms": 24970,
      "source": "asr#13"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "甄嬛",
      "text_zh": "那也未必了，",
      "text_en": "Not necessarily.",
      "start_ms": 25650,
      "end_ms": 26650,
      "source": "asr#14"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "甄嬛",
      "text_zh": "王爷",
      "text_en": "The prince",
      "start_ms": 27330,
      "end_ms": 27810,
      "source": "asr#15"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "甄嬛",
      "text_zh": "征战沙场，为国杀敌，",
      "text_en": "has fought many battles, for the country,",
      "start_ms": 28170,
      "end_ms": 29810,
      "source": "asr#16"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "甄嬛",
      "text_zh": "也算是个英雄。",
      "text_en": "He is a hero.",
      "start_ms": 30250,
      "end_ms": 31250,
      "source": "asr#17"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "甄嬛",
      "text_zh": "那英雄，",
      "text_en": "And a hero,",
      "start_ms": 32410,
      "end_ms": 33090,
      "source": "asr#18"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "甄嬛",
      "text_zh": "最难过哪关？",
      "text_en": "what is his weakness?",
      "start_ms": 34060,
      "end_ms": 34900,
      "source": "asr#19"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "皇上",
      "text_zh": "英雄难过美人关。",
      "text_en": "A hero cannot resist a beauty.",
      "start_ms": 35780,
      "end_ms": 37540,
      "source": "asr#20"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "皇上",
      "text_zh": "你这个机灵鬼啊，",
      "text_en": "You clever girl,",
      "start_ms": 38340,
      "end_ms": 39620,
      "source": "asr#21"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "皇上",
      "text_zh": "亏你能想得出这个招来。",
      "text_en": "only you could [create] this trick.",
      "start_ms": 40020,
      "end_ms": 41620,
      "source": "asr#22",
      "vocab_word": "create",
      "vocab_card_id": "vocab_0001"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "甄嬛",
      "text_zh": "皇上也知道英雄难过美人关啊。",
      "text_en": "So you know a hero falls for beauty.",
      "start_ms": 41940,
      "end_ms": 43940,
      "source": "asr#23"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "甄嬛",
      "text_zh": "臣妾哪里懂得什么国家大事，",
      "text_en": "I do not understand state affairs,",
      "start_ms": 45420,
      "end_ms": 47300,
      "source": "asr#24"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "甄嬛",
      "text_zh": "知道的，",
      "text_en": "What I know",
      "start_ms": 47940,
      "end_ms": 48500,
      "source": "asr#25"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "甄嬛",
      "text_zh": "不过是些妯娌间鸡毛蒜皮的事。",
      "text_en": "is just trivial family matters.",
      "start_ms": 48980,
      "end_ms": 51180,
      "source": "asr#26"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "甄嬛",
      "text_zh": "王爷敬畏福晋，",
      "text_en": "The prince respects his wife,",
      "start_ms": 53300,
      "end_ms": 54300,
      "source": "asr#27"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "甄嬛",
      "text_zh": "此事若由福晋出马，",
      "text_en": "If the princess handles this,",
      "start_ms": 55100,
      "end_ms": 56700,
      "source": "asr#28"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "甄嬛",
      "text_zh": "自然是无往而不利的。",
      "text_en": "it will definitely work.",
      "start_ms": 57220,
      "end_ms": 58620,
      "source": "asr#29"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "甄嬛",
      "text_zh": "臣妾曾与福晋有过数面之缘，",
      "text_en": "I have met the princess a few times,",
      "start_ms": 60200,
      "end_ms": 61960,
      "source": "asr#30"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "甄嬛",
      "text_zh": "知道她",
      "text_en": "and I know she",
      "start_ms": 62520,
      "end_ms": 62960,
      "source": "asr#31"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "甄嬛",
      "text_zh": "并不是一个悍妒无知的妇人。",
      "text_en": "is not a jealous and ignorant woman.",
      "start_ms": 63280,
      "end_ms": 64880,
      "source": "asr#32"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "皇上",
      "text_zh": "那你说，",
      "text_en": "Then tell me,",
      "start_ms": 66090,
      "end_ms": 66690,
      "source": "asr#33"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "皇上",
      "text_zh": "谁去劝敦亲王福晋呢？",
      "text_en": "who should go talk to the princess?",
      "start_ms": 67690,
      "end_ms": 69650,
      "source": "asr#34"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "甄嬛",
      "text_zh": "皇上若不嫌弃臣妾无能，",
      "text_en": "If you do not mind my lack of ability,",
      "start_ms": 70530,
      "end_ms": 72650,
      "source": "asr#35"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "甄嬛",
      "text_zh": "那臣妾",
      "text_en": "then I",
      "start_ms": 73090,
      "end_ms": 73770,
      "source": "asr#36"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "甄嬛",
      "text_zh": "就自告奋勇了。",
      "text_en": "will volunteer.",
      "start_ms": 74330,
      "end_ms": 75530,
      "source": "asr#37"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "皇上",
      "text_zh": "后宫之中，",
      "text_en": "In the palace,",
      "start_ms": 77590,
      "end_ms": 78390,
      "source": "asr#38"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "皇上",
      "text_zh": "只有你",
      "text_en": "only you",
      "start_ms": 79150,
      "end_ms": 79830,
      "source": "asr#39"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "皇上",
      "text_zh": "能为朕",
      "text_en": "can help me",
      "start_ms": 80270,
      "end_ms": 80910,
      "source": "asr#40"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "皇上",
      "text_zh": "排忧解难。",
      "text_en": "solve problems.",
      "start_ms": 81270,
      "end_ms": 82150,
      "source": "asr#41"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "皇上",
      "text_zh": "朕的那些大臣们，",
      "text_en": "My ministers,",
      "start_ms": 83750,
      "end_ms": 85030,
      "source": "asr#42"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "皇上",
      "text_zh": "拿着朕的俸禄，",
      "text_en": "they take my salary,",
      "start_ms": 85550,
      "end_ms": 86590,
      "source": "asr#43"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "皇上",
      "text_zh": "哄闹了半天，",
      "text_en": "made a lot of noise,",
      "start_ms": 87750,
      "end_ms": 88750,
      "source": "asr#44"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "皇上",
      "text_zh": "却只能出些罚与不罚的主意，",
      "text_en": "but only had ideas about punishment.",
      "start_ms": 89670,
      "end_ms": 92230,
      "source": "asr#45"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "皇上",
      "text_zh": "当真是无用之极。",
      "text_en": "Utterly useless.",
      "start_ms": 92310,
      "end_ms": 93990,
      "source": "asr#46"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "甄嬛",
      "text_zh": "臣妾只是后宫中一介区区妇人，",
      "text_en": "I am just a mere woman in the palace,",
      "start_ms": 95090,
      "end_ms": 97330,
      "source": "asr#47"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "甄嬛",
      "text_zh": "哪里是臣妾的主意？",
      "text_en": "How could it be my idea?",
      "start_ms": 98330,
      "end_ms": 99730,
      "source": "asr#48"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "甄嬛",
      "text_zh": "不过是皇上的心意，",
      "text_en": "It is just Your Majesty's intention,",
      "start_ms": 101130,
      "end_ms": 102330,
      "source": "asr#49"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "甄嬛",
      "text_zh": "侥幸被臣妾猜中了而已。",
      "text_en": "that I happened to guess.",
      "start_ms": 103010,
      "end_ms": 104650,
      "source": "asr#50"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "甄嬛",
      "text_zh": "那些大臣们熟悉的是书本伦理，",
      "text_en": "Those ministers know books and ethics,",
      "start_ms": 105770,
      "end_ms": 108290,
      "source": "asr#51"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "甄嬛",
      "text_zh": "可臣妾",
      "text_en": "but I",
      "start_ms": 108690,
      "end_ms": 109370,
      "source": "asr#52"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "甄嬛",
      "text_zh": "熟悉的却是皇上。",
      "text_en": "know you.",
      "start_ms": 110090,
      "end_ms": 111210,
      "source": "asr#53"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "甄嬛",
      "text_zh": "皇上的天意，",
      "text_en": "Your thoughts,",
      "start_ms": 112780,
      "end_ms": 113500,
      "source": "asr#54"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "甄嬛",
      "text_zh": "臣妾还是能揣测几分的。",
      "text_en": "I can still guess a bit.",
      "start_ms": 114100,
      "end_ms": 115700,
      "source": "asr#55"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "皇上",
      "text_zh": "嬛嬛，",
      "text_en": "Huan Huan,",
      "start_ms": 116800,
      "end_ms": 117800,
      "source": "gemini"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "皇上",
      "text_zh": "只有你",
      "text_en": "only you",
      "start_ms": 118690,
      "end_ms": 119290,
      "source": "asr#56"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "皇上",
      "text_zh": "最懂朕的心意。",
      "text_en": "know my heart best.",
      "start_ms": 119810,
      "end_ms": 120970,
      "source": "asr#57"
    }
  ],
  "vocab_cards": [
    {
