      "phonetic": "/kriˈeɪt/",
      "original_sentence": "Only you could create this trick.",
      "simple_sentence": "Please create a new file.",
      "explanation_zh": "create 的意思是创造。原句是 Only you could create this trick，意思是只有你才能想出这个主意。简单例句是 Please create a new file，意思是请创建一个新文件。"
    }
  ]
}